TITLE pe from water redox couple (O(-2)/O(0)) at 150C with chrysotile+talc
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
    redox pe
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Chrysotile 0 10
    Talc       0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file peq2.sel
    -reset false
    -pH true
    -pe true
END
